  "correction_rules": [
    "Adjust forecasts downward when sentiment is neutral or negative (sentiment ≤ 0.00) to correct for overestimation bias.",
    "Increase forecast lag by 1-2 days when sentiment is positive (sentiment > 0.00) to account for delayed market reaction.",
    "Reduce forecast overshoot after sharp price spikes by 10-20% to prevent overcorrection.",
    "Apply mean reversion to forecasts when historical 30-day mean is significantly higher than current forecast, especially in low-sentiment periods.",
    "Increase forecast sensitivity to recent true outcomes when sentiment is positive, to capture momentum-driven price shifts."
